  "releaseNotes": "PdfSharpCore (forked by Moondigo)\n      - 1.0.7: Dependancies updated. Supports .NET 8.0 and 9.0.\n      - 1.0.6: Dependancies updated. Droppped support for older .net frameworks version and added 9.0 (no significant code changes, but testing against 9.0)\n      - 1.0.5: Added experimental compressed objects streams support that can actually work (/Type ObjStm) - for accuracy Lazy. Original library caused problems when particular stream /Length dictionary directed to object reference like \"10 0 R\" and that object is in compressed object stream (/Type ObjStm).",
